#!/bin/sh
# The panel's config.txt lines, as a fragment for rpi-boot-firmware: the
# display and camera overlays named by hmihw.display and hmihw.camera, the
# full USB current for the peripherals, and Bluetooth off.

set -eu

dir=$LAYER_WORKDIR/for/rpi-boot-firmware/config.txt.d
mkdir -p "$dir"
{
   echo "# Meltingplot: operator panel"
   [ -z "${IGconf_hmihw_display:-}" ] || printf 'dtoverlay=%s\n' "$IGconf_hmihw_display"
   [ -z "${IGconf_hmihw_camera:-}" ] || printf 'dtoverlay=%s\n' "$IGconf_hmihw_camera"
   echo "usb_max_current_enable=1"
   echo "dtoverlay=disable-bt"
} > "$dir/80-mp-hmi-hw"
